      "title": "Computation, Sound & Silicon",
      "summary": "Information technologies digitized human communication and knowledge. Ada Lovelace envisioned modern software for Babbage's Analytical Engine. The phonograph recorded sound, Marconi invented wireless radio, and the microprocessor powered the personal computer.",
